{"id":1463,"date":"2026-08-23T15:34:11","date_gmt":"2026-08-23T15:34:11","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=1463"},"modified":"2026-08-23T17:41:59","modified_gmt":"2026-08-23T17:41:59","slug":"page-notes","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/layout-tools\/page-notes\/","title":{"rendered":"Page Notes"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Page Notes<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1466\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PageNotes.jpg\" alt=\"Page Notes\" width=\"77\" height=\"127\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PageNotes.jpg 587w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PageNotes-181x300.jpg 181w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 77px) 100vw, 77px\" \/><\/span><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\">For complex multi-page documents, Page Notes let you add short custom labels to individual page thumbnails in the sidebar, making it easy to stay organised and navigate long publications at a glance.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Adding a Page Note<\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">To add a note to a page:<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Right-click the page thumbnail in the left sidebar.<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1469\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/AddNote.webp\" alt=\"Adding a Page Note\" width=\"87\" height=\"175\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/AddNote.webp 365w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/AddNote-149x300.webp 149w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 87px) 100vw, 87px\" \/><\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Select <strong>Add Note<\/strong>.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Type a short identifier (for example: \u201cFront Cover\u201d, \u201cTOC\u201d, \u201cAdvertorial\u201d, or \u201cBack Cover\u201d).<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Press <strong>Enter<\/strong> or click <strong>OK<\/strong>.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p class=\"western\">The note displays directly beneath the thumbnail in a bold teal font. To remove a note, repeat the process and leave the field blank.<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-1481 size-full\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PageNotesDialogs-1.webp\" alt=\"Page Note right click menu alongside Add Page Note dialog\" width=\"1295\" height=\"510\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PageNotesDialogs-1.webp 1295w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PageNotesDialogs-1-300x118.webp 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PageNotesDialogs-1-1024x403.webp 1024w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PageNotesDialogs-1-768x302.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1295px) 100vw, 1295px\" \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Page Notes For complex multi-page documents, Page Notes let you add short custom labels to individual page thumbnails in the sidebar, making it easy to stay organised and navigate long publications at a glance. Adding a Page Note To add a note to a page: Right-click the page thumbnail in the left sidebar. Select Add [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":1477,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[20],"class_list":["post-1463","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-layout-tools"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1463","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/knowledgebase"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1463"}],"version-history":[{"count":11,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1463\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1484,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1463\/revisions\/1484"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/1477"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=1463"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"knowledgebase_cat","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase_cat?post=1463"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}